  "body": "There should be an option to make the test case insensitive. Right now it's always case sensitive:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst p = new URLPattern('/A/:id', 'http://e.e')\r\np.exec('/A/2', 'http://e.e') // { ... }\r\np.exec('/a/2', 'http://e.e') // null\r\n```",
